# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; for clib/runtime, an
# SPDX id of licenses-spdx/, or the path of the library's own license file)
#
# Only what the released binary actually embeds: the runtime shards of
# shard.yml and the shards they pull in (crest, http-client-digest_auth and
# http_proxy; see shard.lock), and the C libraries the stdlib modules the code
# requires link. netbox-client is not listed: it is generated into vendor/ from
# the NetBox OpenAPI document by this project, and ships under its LICENSE.
# Add a line for every runtime shard added. Nothing checks it for you.
#
# CONFIRMED on 2026-11-18 against the link line of this very binary, in
# alpine:3.24 with Alpine's crystal 1.20.3 (the base of the image
# crystalreleaser generates for the linux builds):
#   -lssl -lcrypto -lxml2 -lm -lz -llzma -lyaml -lpcre2-8 -pthread -lgc -ldl
#   (+ musl, libgcc)
# libxml2 and liblzma come from crinja's XML support, openssl from the HTTP
# client. GMP is absent on purpose: the generated client required "big"
# without using it, which linked libgmp (LGPL-3.0, statically) for nothing;
# vendor/netbox-client-patches/03-no-big.diff drops it. Versions and licenses
# as apk records them in that image: openssl 3.5.9 Apache-2.0, libxml2 2.13.9
# MIT, xz-libs 5.8.4 (liblzma alone is 0BSD; the GPL parts of xz are the
# command-line tools), yaml 0.2.5 MIT, pcre2 10.49 BSD-3-Clause, zlib 1.4
# Zlib, musl 1.2.6 MIT, gc 8.2.12 Boehm-GC. The darwin binaries link Homebrew's
# openssl@4 (Apache-2.0) statically; the other libraries come from macOS or
# from the compiler mise installs. Check the link line again when a stdlib
# module is added or the image moves.
#
# MIT, BSD-3-Clause, zlib and 0BSD texts are templates whose copyright line is
# a blank: those libraries embed their own license file, taken from their
# sources at the versions above:
#   libxml2  Copyright      gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2  tag v2.13.9
#   liblzma  COPYING.0BSD   github.com/tukaani-project/xz   tag v5.8.4
#   libyaml  License        github.com/yaml/libyaml         tag 0.2.5
#   pcre2    LICENCE.md     github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2   tag pcre2-10.49
#   zlib     LICENSE        github.com/madler/zlib          tag v1.4
#   musl     COPYRIGHT      git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl     tag v1.2.6
shard   | admiral                 | lib/admiral/LICENSE
shard   | any_hash                | lib/any_hash/LICENSE
shard   | baked_file_system       | lib/baked_file_system/LICENSE
shard   | cr-color-logging        | lib/cr-color-logging/LICENSE
shard   | crest                   | lib/crest/LICENSE
shard   | crinja                  | lib/crinja/LICENSE
shard   | crystal-env             | lib/crystal-env/LICENSE
shard   | dotenv                  | lib/dotenv/LICENSE
shard   | http-client-digest_auth | lib/http-client-digest_auth/LICENSE
shard   | http_proxy              | lib/http_proxy/LICENSE
clib    | openssl                 | Apache-2.0
clib    | libxml2                 | licenses-upstream/libxml2.txt
clib    | liblzma                 | licenses-upstream/liblzma.txt
clib    | libyaml                 | licenses-upstream/libyaml.txt
clib    | pcre2                   | licenses-upstream/pcre2.txt
clib    | zlib                    | licenses-upstream/zlib.txt
clib    | boehm-gc                | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl                    | licenses-upstream/musl.txt
clib    | libgcc                  | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal                 | Apache-2.0
project | netbox-extractor        | LICENSE
